---
import Section from '../../layouts/Section.astro';
import Term from '../../components/Term.astro';
import { PLANNED_PAGE_LAYOUTS } from '../../data/nav';
---
<Section section="patterns">
  <p slot="intro">Each <Term id="pattern">pattern</Term> tells the story of one problem that comes up in many apps: what people need, how we solve it, and why. Its drawings show the idea; the component pages show the real thing, live. <Term id="page-layout">Page layouts</Term> are whole pages; the other patterns solve one problem inside a page.</p>
  <h2 id="planned">planned</h2>
  <p>Page layouts that aren't here yet. Until they are, put them together from the components and the patterns above.</p>
  <ul class="ds-cards" data-pagefind-ignore>
    {PLANNED_PAGE_LAYOUTS.map((p) => (
      <li>
        <div class="ds-card">
          <span class="ds-card__title">{p.title}</span>
          <span class="ds-card__summary">{p.summary}</span>
          <span class="ds-card__meta">planned</span>
        </div>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ul>
</Section>
